Package: stockr
Title: Stock Screening, Signal and Portfolio Tools for A-Shares
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Qingfeng", "Liu", email = "qingfeng@example.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A pure base-R toolkit for A-share investment decision support:
    live and historical quotes (Tencent/Sina, zero dependencies),
    technical indicators (MA, RSI, MACD, Bollinger, ATR), composite
    trend/value/momentum scoring with plain-Chinese advice labels,
    long-only portfolio optimisation (max Sharpe, min variance, risk
    parity), strategy backtesting and parameter tuning. Ships with a
    four-stock universe (600502, 601669, 600966, 601908) workflow that
    produces a ranked investment-advice report.
